      "content": "that's pretty powerful. i like the \"must we\" part. \n\none thing though—some of our more skeptical donors might push back on the \"moral imperative\" angle by saying it's actually a strategic necessity too, like for national security or global stability. could you add a paragraph that bridges those two? i want to make it clear that helping them actually helps us too, and that anyone who argues against aid is basically ignoring how interconnected the world is now.",
